  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 601.03 Incorporated Definitions, Abbreviations and Acronyms. Any term, abbreviation, or acronym used in this chapter that is not defined herein but is defined in Env-Wt 100 shall have the meaning established in Env-Wt 100, as summarized in Appendix E.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
